cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AI Grader Pro, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AI Grader Pro: AI-assisted grading for Moodle assignments"
abstract: "Moodle local plugin that proposes per-criterion grades and structured feedback for assignments using the Moodle AI subsystem. The teacher reviews and decides; nothing reaches the gradebook without an explicit teacher action. Provider-agnostic, with student anonymisation and an audit trail."
